ind":"update","title":"Update 0.3.3: The Ledger, the Armory, and guns that fight back","summary":"Vessel keeps a ledger. Every deal he has ever made is written in it, and now some of the lines are yours.The LedgerA new page on the main menu, and on the Leaderboards page in the pause menu.- Twelve entries, three open at a time. Kill fifty with headshots. Cripple forty legs. Stamp out fifteen crawlers. Fell four Brutes. Survive twenty-five minutes. Kill a thousand.- Progress counts across every run and is saved when you quit. Fill an entry and Vessel signs it, then the next line in the book op","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T17:16:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042426","verified_at":"2026-10-25T21:48:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1847286114041363","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.3.2: health comes back and every zombie has a weakness","summary":"This one comes from the first Early Access feedback thread and a long evening of my own play-testing. Thank you to everyone who wrote in. The early game was harder than I meant it to be, and a few things that looked like bugs in the moment turned out to be exactly that.The first ten wavesI went back to how the classic round-based zombie games handled their opening rounds and borrowed the shape.- On Normal, health comes back. Six seconds after the last hit, you regenerate to full over about four ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:25:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041363","verified_at":"2026-10-25T10:50:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1847286114029300","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.3.1: the shove works now, and the early waves ease you in","summary":"Update 0.3.1Two days of Next Fest feedback, and most of it came down to one thing: the shove. In the test scene it threw zombies off you. In the game it played the animation and did nothing. One line of code decided that, and it has been wrong since the day the shove went in. It is fixed, and while I was in there I went through the rest of the list.The shove- G on keyboard, click the right stick on a pad. It now pushes every zombie around you, not just the one in front, and the big ones go too.-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:42:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029300","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1846651706691895","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.3.0","summary":"The Day 31 demo has been updated for Next Fest.The dead move differently now. They come at mixed speeds and try to surround you. They climb over what's in your way and drop down after you. You can shove them off. You can knock them down.There are machines in the halls, stamped VESSEL. Walk up and one opens. It sells attachments for the gun in your hands, and health. The menu shows the part and the gun it fits. Buy a sight once and it stays yours for the run.New parts: holographic sights, micro r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:43:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691895","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1846018067941396","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"announcement","title":"**Online co-op is coming to Day 31.**","summary":"**How it works**- Host a game from the main menu and invite a friend straight from your Steam friends list.- They accept the invite and load into your run.- Voice chat is built in. Push to talk by default (Caps Lock, rebindable on the Controls tab), or switch to open mic in Options > Audio.- There is a mic test in the same menu, so you can check your levels before you go in. Mic device and gain come from your Steam voice settings.**Where it stands**Online co-op is built and in two-PC testing now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:41:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941396","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1843481262697659","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix is live, and here's what your feedback changed","summary":"The first tester bug report came in within a day of the demo going up: someone bought a door into an unfinished room, found an open window with no collision, and dropped to the bottom of the map. That's what a demo is for, and it's fixed. Build 3 is live on Steam right now. Below that is everything the rest of your feedback changed, which is in testing for the next demo update. ## Live now: demo build 3 - Unfinished rooms are sealed in the demo. The door still shows a prompt; it reads SEALED in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T15:23:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1843481262692943","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"update","title":"Demo hotfix is live, and here's what your feedback changed","summary":"The first tester bug report came in within a day of the demo going up: someone bought a door into an unfinished room, found an open window with no collision, and dropped to the bottom of the map. That's what a demo is for, and it's fixed. Build 3 is live on Steam right now. Below that is everything the rest of your feedback changed, which is in testing for the next demo update. ## Live now: demo build 3 - Unfinished rooms are sealed in the demo. The door still shows a prompt; it reads SEALED in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T17:07:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692943","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4949100-1842846814449359","game_id":"steam-4949100","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.2.1: You can't fall out of the world anymore","summary":"The Day 31 demo is free on Steam right now, and four days of people playing itfound more than a year of me testing it myself did.Thanks to everyone who has played and reported, and to st3ve in particular forjumping out a window I did not know was open.FIXED- Map holes. Windows and openings in unfinished areas have collision now.- Fall catcher. Leaving the level puts you back on your feet instead of ending the run.- Sealed doors. Rooms that are not finished yet are locked. They cost nerve to open","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T16:18:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449359","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4949100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4949100":"2026-10-26T05:33:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4949100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33: